"""SimpleChat backend.

A single FastAPI application exposing:

* ``/auth/register`` and ``/auth/login`` — account creation and JWT login
* ``/messages`` (GET/POST) and ``/messages/search`` — chat CRUD + search
* ``/messages/upload`` and ``/files/{id}`` — file/image sharing
* ``/groups`` (GET/POST) and ``/groups/{id}/join`` — group chats
* ``/ws`` — authenticated WebSocket channel that pushes new messages in real time

All DB access goes through ``database.py``; all auth goes through ``auth.py``.
"""

